One hundredth at 25,830 is 258 dollars 30.

271
00:09:57,095 --> 00:09:59,735
Together that is 801 dollars 90.

272
00:10:00,255 --> 00:10:02,431
A little below the band, at a

273
00:10:02,431 --> 00:10:04,805
made-up price of 24,000, that

274
00:10:04,805 --> 00:10:06,882
coin is worth 720 dollars.

275
00:10:07,402 --> 00:10:09,028
You are down 81 dollars 90

276
00:10:09,028 --> 00:10:10,964
before fees, and the loss keeps

277
00:10:10,964 --> 00:10:12,822
growing until your stop acts.

278
